From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bench Fixture <bench@example.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 19:27:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: answer ping with 503 while in maintenance

While a project is in maintenance the ping REST view answers 503 with
maintenanceMessage and the SSH command fails with the same text instead
of printing pong. A REST view may not return a 5xx Response, so the
view throws MaintenanceException and an ExceptionHook maps it to 503.

The answer is per project, so the message may now name it: the getter
takes the project and expands ${project} in the configured text.
